OL,3,GNEWSAGirl thought fatal chase was game
OL,4,Aof hide-and-seek
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 12-year-old girl described seeing
OL,7,Fwhat she thought was a "game of hide
OL,8,Fand seek" moments before a 16-year-old
OL,9,Fboy was fatally stabbed at a shopping
OL,10,Fprecinct.
OL,12,FBaye Bireme Fall, known as BB, died
OL,13,Ffrom a single stab wound after a
OL,14,Fconfrontation near the Ortongate
OL,15,FShopping Centre in Peterborough on 12
OL,16,FApril.
OL,18,FEmidas Krutkevicius, 18, from Garton
OL,19,FEnd Road in the city, and a 15-year-old
OL,20,Fboy, who cannot be named for legal
OL,21,Freasons, are on trial at Peterborough
OL,22,FCrown Court where they deny murder.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,379,370,200,160,0,100
