OL,3,GNEWSAGirl thought fatal chase was game
OL,4,Aof hide-and-seek
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a police interview played in court,
OL,7,Fthe girl said she saw Baye being chased
OL,8,Fby the defendants, and added that she
OL,9,F"had a bad feeling about them".
